  "把机器人放在同一张表里，也保留它们各自的测试条件。": "Compare robots in one table while retaining their individual test conditions.",
  "如何阅读参数": "How to read the metrics",
  "质量与尺度": "Mass & scale",
  "含电池、裸机、含上装及外部供能分别记录。站立外包络、机身尺寸和髋高也不混用。": "Battery inclusion, bare mass, payload assemblies and external power are distinguished. Standing envelope, body dimensions and hip height are separate.",
  "载重": "Payload",
  "浏览与筛选采用公开的标称 / 持续载重。极限载重和站立静载在详情里单列。设计选型工况不当作已验证的载重能力。": "Browsing and filtering use published nominal / continuous payload. Extreme and static loads are separate. Design targets are not verified load capacity.",
  "速度": "Speed",
  "卡片显示最高已披露值，并在详情保留工作范围、实验室极限、跑步机及控制器条件。该数值不是所有场景下的持续速度。": "Cards show the highest reported speed, retaining operating range, experimental limits, treadmill and controller conditions in details. This is not continuous speed in every setting.",
  "区分空载、带载、巡检任务、站立和待机。筛选取记录的续航下值，不把最高速度和最长续航拼成一个工况。": "Unloaded, loaded, inspection, standing and standby runtime are distinct. Filters use the recorded lower bound. Maximum speed and longest runtime are not combined into one operating condition.",
  "关节与传动": "Joints & transmission",
  "区分执行器输出与关节末端、峰值与连续值，以及已确认型号与选型推断。最大单关节扭矩不代表整机全部轴的额定能力。": "Actuator output and joint-end torque, peak and continuous values, and confirmed part numbers and inferences are distinct. Maximum single-joint torque is not the rating of every axis.",
  "图片与配置": "Images & configurations",
  "图片来自厂商、研究机构或原始论文，并保留来源。部分为产品家族参考图，具体配置和修订版以文字记录为准。": "Images come from manufacturers, research groups or original papers with attribution. Some illustrate a product family; the text defines the exact configuration and revision.",
  "当前版本": "Current release",
  "首版覆盖宇树四足产品线、Spot、ANYmal多个代际、DEEP Robotics、Ghost Robotics，以及MIT、IIT、ETH、ODRI研究平台。旧型号和未公开参数保留空缺。人形与机械臂未混入此四足浏览页。": "Coverage includes Unitree quadrupeds, Spot, multiple ANYmal generations, DEEP Robotics, Ghost Robotics and MIT, IIT, ETH and ODRI platforms. Historical models and missing specifications are retained.",
  "实验室 ANYmal 的代际暂未确认，尚未与某条产品记录绑定。": "The laboratory’s ANYmal generation is unconfirmed and has not been linked to a particular record.",
  "完整性能矩阵": "Full specification matrix",
  "结构化资料 JSON": "Structured data JSON",
  "规划中 · 单臂与双臂平台": "Planned · single- and dual-arm platforms",
  "从单臂运动能力，到双臂协作与移动操作。": "From single-arm motion to bimanual coordination and mobile manipulation.",
  "将整机、关节驱动和末端灵巧手连接到同一套可追溯资料中。": "Connect robot bodies, actuators and dexterous end effectors through traceable evidence.",
  "单臂平台": "Single-arm platforms",
  "自由度、臂展、额定负载、整机质量、重复定位精度、最大末端速度与控制接口。": "DOF, reach, rated payload, mass, repeatability, maximum end-effector speed and control interfaces.",
  "双臂平台": "Dual-arm platforms",
  "双臂独立/协同负载、共同工作空间、底座与躯干轴、臂间碰撞约束及双臂同步控制。": "Independent and coordinated payload, shared workspace, base and torso axes, collision constraints and synchronized control.",
  "驱动与末端": "Actuation & end effectors",
  "各轴执行器、传动与力矩感知；末端法兰、手部供电和通信接口，区分出厂组合与实验室改装。": "Axis actuators, transmission and torque sensing; flanges, hand power and communication. Factory configurations and laboratory modifications remain distinct.",
  "浏览灵巧手 →": "Explore dexterous hands →",
  "浏览关节驱动器": "Explore actuators",
  "当前尚未收录机械臂型号。单臂额定负载不能直接相加作为双臂协同负载，重复定位精度也不等于绝对定位精度。": "Arm records are planned. Single-arm ratings cannot simply be added to claim coordinated payload. Repeatability is distinct from absolute accuracy.",
